cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "openfoam-amgx: GPU linear solvers for OpenFOAM via NVIDIA AmgX"
abstract: >-
  A drop-in OpenFOAM lduMatrix::solver implementation that offloads sparse
  linear solves to NVIDIA GPUs using AmgX, with serial and MPI parallel support.
authors:
  - name: "openfoam-amgx contributors"
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - OpenFOAM
  - AmgX
  - CUDA
  - GPU
  - CFD
  - linear solver
